LinkAgent: PC to Amiga file transfer over the keyboard port.

Boot your own Workbench 1.3 and open a Shell, then:

One drive:
  Run LinkAgent:LinkAgent      insert this disk when asked,
                               then put Workbench back
Second drive or hard disk:
  Execute LinkAgent:Start      run it now, nothing installed
  Execute LinkAgent:Install    copy it to your boot disk

Keep the LinkAgent window visible during transfers.
Source and documentation: github.com/keithgh1/amiga-keyboard-interface
